        "question": "The radius of a sphere is increasing at the rate of $0.2 \\, \\text{cm/s}$. The rate of increase of its surface area when the radius is $10 \\, \\text{cm}$ is:",
        "type": "mcq",
        "options": [
          {
            "letter": "A",
            "text": "$16\\pi \\, \\text{cm}^2/\\text{s}$",
